お忙しいと思いますので無理せず、厳しければスケブの規約通りスルーしていただければと思います！ご検討の程、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kjose_5/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2045140, "client_id": 1043745, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57304617619d1b2f63338eaeb94d158f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57304617619d1b2f63338eaeb94d158f, https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d367b170b8cfae8101bb0392df35437 2x, https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29bb673b2b010fde2ad883e006c91536 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=899bd288caebda4be0f50b504f4c1b78", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=899bd288caebda4be0f50b504f4c1b78, https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d6b341a333bfb58f9e871d43110ed130 2x, https://si.imgix.net/627a1d72/uploads/origins/519081e3-0453-4307-8dd8-f321a3b47844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&